    "subject": "查询编码接口报错：LINQ to Entities 不识别 AddDays",
    "context": "#001",
    "content": "## 问题\nTab2「已生成编码」→ 点击「查询编码」→ 接口 `/api/CodeGenerator/CodeGenerator/GetCodeRecords` 报错：\n\n> LINQ to Entities does not recognize the method 'System.DateTime AddDays(Double)' method, and this method cannot be translated into a store expression.\n\n## 排查方向\n获取编码记录时，LINQ 查询中调用了 `DateTime.AddDays()`，EF6 无法将其翻译为 SQL。需将日期计算移到查询外部（先取日期值，再作为参数传入 LINQ）。",
    "files": ["D:/work/cc/caikuangzi.fenlu/trunk/SAHG.Salt.Application/CodeGenerator/CodeGeneratorService.cs"],
    "actions": ["定位 GetCodeRecords 中 AddDays 调用", "将 AddDays 计算移到 LINQ 表达式外部"],
    "deadline": null
  }
}
